[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: [DRAFT] Project Summary

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document summaries the user needs for the editor.


The editor's primary purpose is editing of text files, specifically source code but also markup languages.

The editor is aimed at a broad target group, providing various configuration options to suit the user's needs. While an opinionated default configuration is available, power-users can benefit from extensive extensibility options, including a plugin system. All features follow the principle of being intuitive to use, lowering the entry barrier for users to optimize their workflow e.g. by trying out new features.
<<<

