TITLE: Licensing and Distribution

[[/SECTION]]

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
- Open Source
- Open Source Dependencies
- Free as in freedom, not free coffee.
- Software fully owned by the user. No subscriptions. No proprietary features.
<<<

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Reliable

[[/SECTION]]

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Information shall never be lost due to an error of the editor.
<<<

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Consistent

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Behavior, UX and the UI shall be consistent.
<<<

